## Reporting Correlation

### Example 2: answers

::: {.callout-important .nonincremental}
## Answers

1.  **72%** of the variance in exam scores is explained by study time, and **28%** remains unexplained. ($R^2 = r^2 = .85^2 \approx .72$)
